#: includes/splash-page/gf_splash.php:137
msgid ""
"As part of our continuing commitment to make form building available to "
"everyone, we have improved the accessibility of the form editor. If you rely on "
"keyboard navigation or screen readers, you’ll now have an easier time navigating "
"the field settings."
